{
  "id": "b03",
  "title": "The Purse by the Pond",
  "titleZh": "池塘边的钱包",
  "topic": "社区",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our last chemistry class ends with a short word game.",
        "zh": "我们最后一节化学课以一个短短的词语游戏结束。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A riddle in white chalk covers the old board.",
        "zh": "一道用白色粉笔写的谜语占满了旧黑板。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We read the answer aloud in the quiet classroom.",
        "zh": "我们在安静的教室里大声读出答案。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her fingers dance on the keyboard, and we all clap loudly.",
        "zh": "她的手指在键盘上飞舞，我们都大声鼓掌。"
      },
      {
        "en": "After our physics class, we walk around the old gymnasium.",
        "zh": "物理课后，我们绕着旧体育馆走了一圈。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Vacation starts today, and the warm sun shines again.",
        "zh": "假期今天开始，温暖的阳光又照了下来。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We walk down the hill and cross the small, quiet street.",
        "zh": "我们走下山坡，穿过那条安静的小街。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I skate past a boy on an old red bicycle.",
        "zh": "我滑着旱冰经过一个骑着旧红色自行车的男孩。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A white goat stands near the quiet, green pond.",
        "zh": "一只白山羊站在安静的绿色池塘边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A wet hen hides under one big black umbrella.",
        "zh": "一只湿漉漉的母鸡躲在一把黑色大伞下面。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The polite postman waves and asks about our long day.",
        "zh": "有礼貌的邮递员朝我们挥手，问我们今天过得怎么样。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A brown purse holds a coin and an old photo.",
        "zh": "一个棕色的钱包里装着一枚硬币和一张旧照片。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A license and a single cent sit inside it now.",
        "zh": "里面还放着一张证件和一枚一分硬币。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The silk lining is soft, and the purse is hers.",
        "zh": "丝绸内衬很柔软，这个钱包是她的。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The photo is theirs, and we connect the two names.",
        "zh": "照片是他们的，我们把两个名字联系了起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its owner is deaf and seldom leaves her warm house.",
        "zh": "它的主人耳朵听不见，很少离开她温暖的家。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She was a pioneer, and her grandchild lives far away.",
        "zh": "她曾是这个小镇的开拓者，她的孙辈住在很远的地方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We send an email and wait downstairs by the door.",
        "zh": "我们发了一封电子邮件，然后在楼下门口等着。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "She walks to the old stairs with a clean towel.",
        "zh": "她拿着一块干净的毛巾走到旧楼梯边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My headache grows, but the hot beef smells good.",
        "zh": "我的头越来越疼，但热牛肉闻起来很香。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A lamb dish and a dumpling sit on the table.",
        "zh": "一盘羊肉和一只饺子摆在桌上。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One sandwich weighs almost a kilogram, I really think.",
        "zh": "一个三明治差不多有一公斤重，我真是这么觉得。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A watermelon and a bag of grapes wait for us.",
        "zh": "一个西瓜和一袋葡萄在等着我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A pear ends our warm supper that quiet evening.",
        "zh": "那个安静的傍晚，一个梨为我们的热晚饭收了尾。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "We take the long path home before the dark.",
        "zh": "我们在天黑前沿着长长的小路回家。"
      },
      {
        "en": "She used a taxi to visit us last cold winter.",
        "zh": "去年寒冷的冬天，她坐出租车来看过我们。"
      },
      {
        "en": "I draw a small fox for her with my pencil.",
        "zh": "我用铅笔画了一只小狐狸送给她。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her grandson brings the old handbag to our door.",
        "zh": "她的孙子把那个旧手提包送到我们家门口。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her handwriting is neat, and the grandparent smiles.",
        "zh": "她的字迹很工整，那位祖母朝我们笑了。"
      }
    ]
  ],
